# What the assistant says when a provider fails or stalls (conversation fallbacks).
fallback-model-unavailable = Sorry, I lost my connection. Could you say that again?
fallback-model-slow = Hmm, I'm a bit slow, give me a second.
fallback-recognition-unavailable = I can't hear you very well, my connection is acting up.
fallback-synthesis-unavailable = My voice has a problem, I'll be back as soon as I can.
